    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d493">

                <pb facs="0673" n="579" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg579"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Knight to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Cape Town</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-04-28"><hi rendition="#italic">April 28,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Hammond, with other leaders, pleaded guilty. Have been sentenced death.
                    Understood sentence will be commuted.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Knight.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
